{"3208450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pixelarium: Free Lands", "steam_appid": 3208450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a journey into the Free Lands</strong> — where the title of &quot;hero&quot; veils a bitter truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle dangerous creatures and demons, and uncover dark secrets in this turn-based, open-world roguelike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you defeat the Supreme Demons and stop the invasion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208450/extras/0996a75a29fcb7c3a7f14289016dd5cb.avif?t=1778674547\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208450/extras_big/0996a75a29fcb7c3a7f14289016dd5cb.avif?t=1778674547 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-World Exploration</strong> – Roam freely across a vast world. From lush forests to scorched volcanic deserts, the environment shifts dramatically as you approach the island's core. Exploration is rewarded with hidden locations, treasures, and numerous dungeons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freedom to Build Your Character</strong> – Create a truly unique hero without being locked into a class system. Customize your abilities and stats to match your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 Game Modes</strong> – Choose the mode that best fits your playstyle. You can take on more challenging modes with permadeath, where every mistake can be your last, or choose more narrative-driven, freeform, or immersive experiences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Spell System</strong> – Master a wide range of spells distinct mechanics: elemental forces, poison, translocation, summoning, and more. Combine them creatively to overcome deadly encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ Items</strong> – Discover weapons, armor, potions, and mounts that will enhance your character and allow for a personalized playstyle. Seek out unique items that will help you overcome the most dangerous encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Story &amp; Procedural Side Quests</strong> – Engage in the main storyline while enjoying procedurally generated side quests that provide new challenges with every playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Dungeons</strong> – Descend into caves and caverns filled with traps, hidden treasures, and powerful enemies guarding valuable rewards. No dungeon is ever the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed Sound Design</strong> – Every sound has been carefully crafted to match the game's atmosphere. From the peaceful environment to the intense combat, the high-quality sound effects are designed to immerse you fully in your adventure.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a journey into the Free Lands</strong> — where the title of &quot;hero&quot; veils a bitter truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle dangerous creatures and demons, and uncover dark secrets in this turn-based, open-world roguelike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you defeat the Supreme Demons and stop the invasion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208450/extras/0996a75a29fcb7c3a7f14289016dd5cb.avif?t=1778674547\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208450/extras_big/0996a75a29fcb7c3a7f14289016dd5cb.avif?t=1778674547 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragra