e you fully in your adventure.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "short_description": "Pixelarium is an open-world roguelike RPG with deep character building, fluid turn-based combat, and ASCII-inspired art. Collect unique items, master powerful spells, and embark on quests as you uncover secrets in the Free Lands.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208450/8a607e53325503052bb612671aa5b4639e5f2338/header.jpg?t=1778674547", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208450/6fb6f0f4e0f614b34ce40977312abe4e213e77d2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778674547", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208450/6fb6f0f4e0f614b34ce40977312abe4e213e77d2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778674547", "website": "https://forjagames.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (SP1+), Windows 10, Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core Processor 2.2Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1GB Dedicated VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul clas